{"updated":"2026-11-09T21:13:26.686Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfholIMEy_v","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfholIMEy_v","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"誰說網站 UI 一定要走極簡風？像素風介面真的越看越上癮！🎮\n\n而且不只支援 React，現在連 Vue、Angular 都能用了！🤯\n\n🎨 內建 111 種 UI 元件，按鈕、表單、彈窗、圖表通通有 \n🕹️ 超過 226 個像素風 SVG Icon，涵蓋 7 大主題 \n✨ 支援動態圖示、Hover 動畫與 3D 視差效果 \n🛠️ 提供視覺化 Icon Builder，自由設計像素圖示 \n📱 內建 6 種頁面模板，快速打造復古風網站 \n⚡ 支援 React、Vue 3、Angular 與 Tailwind CSS v4\n\n最酷的是，連通知訊息、互動元件都能維持一致的像素風格！\n\n拿來做個人作品集、遊戲官網、開發者工具或 RPG 風格 Dashboard，感覺超適合！🔥\n#OpenSource #GitHub #PixelArt #React #Vue","timestamp":"2026-11-09T15:17:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhomDLk1pq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhomDLk1pq","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上展示：\npxlkit.xyz\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/Joang…\n\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T15:17:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhVjYHE90T","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhVjYHE90T","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做武俠遊戲，最難的可能不是戰鬥系統，而是那些帥到不行的劍氣、符咒與水墨特效！ \n⚔️ 這次分享一個我自己開發的開源專案：InkFX\n\n一套專為遊戲與互動網頁打造的程式化水墨特效庫！ \n目前內建 132 種特效、6 大類、4 種配色。 \n⚔️ 劍氣斬擊、劍光軌跡與筆刷特效 \n🧧 符咒、法陣與結界封印 \n🍃 飄葉、煙霧、水波等禪意動畫 \n💥 水墨爆炸、衝擊波與墨汁飛濺\n🎬 水墨轉場、卷軸展開動畫 \n🎨 支援松煙、朱砂、石青、泥金配色\n最酷的是，特效不需要逐幀手繪，而是透過 JavaScript 程式生成，還能自訂隨機種子，重現相同的動畫效果\n也支援匯出透明 PNG Sprite Sheet、JSON Atlas 與獨立 ES Module，方便整合到遊戲或網站\n如果你也喜歡武俠、水墨或國風遊戲\n歡迎來玩玩看\n #OpenSource #GameDev #JavaScript #IndieGame #InkFX","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:31:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhVkahE1xD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhVkahE1xD","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗： malilion.github.io/inkfx 🔗 GitHub： github.com/malil…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」！\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:31:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhCTTngIMn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhCTTngIMn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"沒想到一個像素沙盒，竟然能玩出化學實驗、黑洞，甚至超新星爆炸\n\n🔥 33 種材料，模擬火焰、水流、爆炸與植物生長\n🧪 化學實驗室，支援 78 種化學反應\n🌌 黑洞、星系、超新星與煙火粒子特效\n⚛️ 3D 元素週期表，探索 118 種元素\n🎨 ASCII 花園、數學視覺化與 3D 圖形\n👥 支援最多 9 人連線，共同創造沙盒世界\n🎮 內建 7 個挑戰關卡，還能自由創作\n\n整個專案使用 TypeScript、WebGL 與 Web Worker，模擬以固定 60Hz 運作，連圖形與音樂都是程式化生成\n#OpenSource #GitHub #TypeScript #WebGL #PixelArt","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:43:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhCZH0k92W","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhCZH0k92W","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗：\ncloverag.github.io/pixel…\n\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/Clove…\n\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:43:45.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfguGBBgCFD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfguGBBgCFD","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"沒想到一棵樹也能做得這麼精緻，甚至還能直接拿來當遊戲素材！🌳🤯\n\n🌳 內建橡樹、松樹、柳樹等 6 種植被\n🌸 支援春天、秋天、櫻花、冰霜與夜晚主題\n🍃 模擬風吹樹葉、落葉飄散與樹木生長\n🎨 自訂樹枝、葉片、光影與顏色\n🎮 匯出 GLB 模型、PNG、Sprite Sheet\n⚡ 支援 LOD 多細節層級，方便遊戲效能最佳化\n\n最酷的是，整棵樹都是由程式生成，連葉片貼圖也不例外，不需要事先建模！\n\n而且直接開瀏覽器就能玩，調整完還能匯出素材，拿來做獨立遊戲或 3D 場景真的超適合！🔥\n\n#ThreeJS #WebGPU #OpenSource #GameDev #ProceduralGeneration","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:47:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfguRxsExDn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfguRxsExDn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗：\njustasimpletree.com\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/MikeF…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:47:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"Dfhfvg9Ac3B","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfhfvg9Ac3B","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原 PO 因為期中考太忙\n用 AI 輔助排版簡報\n卻被同學酸「很偷懶、不尊重人」\n直接陷入自我懷疑🥲\n\n明明報告內容都是自己準備的\nAI 只是幫忙套模板 這樣真的算偷懶嗎？\n原 PO 也忍不住發問\n不知道現在出社會的上班族\n公司能不能接受員工用 AI 做簡報？\n\n好奇問問大家\n覺得用 AI 幫忙做簡報是「聰明有效率」\n還是「偷吃步」呢？🤔","timestamp":"2026-11-09T14:00:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":15,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhfwxJAfvn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhfwxJAfvn","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨用AI做簡報真的很糟糕嗎🥹😭✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多心情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-09T14:00:23.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhY7bdCLEy","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhY7bdCLEy","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編剛滑到這篇\n原 PO 的對象因為投資失敗\n背了高達 1800 萬的房貸\n每個月光是還款就要 7 到 8 萬！\n\n雖然男方表明不需要原 PO 幫忙\n打算自己扛下 30 年的債務從頭開始\n但還是讓月薪 3 萬的原 PO 嚇得發問：\n「這樣的男人你們敢嫁、敢生小孩嗎？」🤔\n\n好奇問問大家\n如果另一半有鉅額負債\n真的有勇氣跟他一起步入婚姻嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-09T13:00:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhY9uICL5_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhY9uICL5_","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨（結束）負債1800萬的男人你們敢嫁嗎✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-09T13:01:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhSCqbjNj5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhSCqbjNj5","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"小編看到有人分享\n神人同學的奇葩事蹟🤯\n\n1. 大學還沒開始就被女同學封鎖（他去私訊對方） \n2. 穿西裝上學 \n3. 看起來完全沒在運動 但認真覺得自己很壯\n4. 熱衷動漫和電動 但喜歡營造運動咖人設（只要有足球的貼文都會按讚 講兩句就要提一下自己會踢足球） \n5. 常常暗示自己人脈很廣 邀請其他人去吃飯多次被當面婉拒 \n6. 當共筆組長不審共筆（他自己說的）然後到處和人說不用寫共筆很爽 反正XX會弄（負責共筆終審的同學）\n\n你們最不能接受哪一點呢？","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:00:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":15,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhSDk9jBut","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfhSDk9jBut","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨分享神人同學的奇葩事蹟✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:00:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DfhwAZIitMD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhwAZIitMD","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"iPhone / iPad 秒變 Macbook！Henge 預告","timestamp":"2026-11-09T16:23:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhXE71GevZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhXE71GevZ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"可以外接螢幕鍵盤滑鼠","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:44:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhWMXHFMoK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhWMXHFMoK","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"舊電腦背後那排 25 針接口，你還記得嗎？並列埠曾是連接印表機的熟面孔，也支援其他周邊，後來還衍生 EPP、ECP 等改良版本。它和序列埠有什麼不同，又為何逐漸被 USB 取代？一起回顧。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:36:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhWgzWlGNM","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhWgzWlGNM","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:39:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhBYFglEP7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhBYFglEP7","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"27 吋閨蜜機不只能推著走！OVO TT6 的螢幕可拆下、換桌面支架，接遊戲機或當筆電副螢幕，使用情境多了不少。這篇從組裝、觸控到影音表現實際開箱，搬上桌後有哪些細節要留意？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:34:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhBYrFFOtR","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhBYrFFOtR","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:34:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfhYW_OH8o_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfhYW_OH8o_","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"我的 reset 勒！\n\nGrok Bot 近期傳出使用量劇增的情況\n雖然沒有明顯感受到\n\nLine 群組裡面朋友們把它玩的咪咪冒冒也還夠\n但發 reset 就是讚，有用的朋友們可以看看是否收到了","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:55:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":10,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Line 群組裡面有個 Grok Bot 真的超方便\n\nBot 可以做到：\n- 詢問大家方便聚餐的時間\n- 找餐廳給大家選\n- 選好餐廳後直接打開 inline 或 Open Table 網頁訂位\n- 訂完位之後就順便建立行事曆\n- 把行事曆連結丟回到群組\n\n以前還要有個人當主揪\n現在直接把主揪丟給 AI 來當就好","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":269,"replies":31,"reposts":22,"shares":194},"score":397,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe_a1BH9tN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfe_a1BH9tN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"圖文版上架囉！","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:39:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfeH9LAG9Cx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfeH9LAG9Cx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"iPhone手機複製，Mac 直接貼上。\n中間不用傳給Line了！！\n​\n這個功能叫「通用剪貼板」，\n跟 AirDrop 一樣是蘋果內建的互通功能，\n文字、圖片都能直接過去。\n​\n◼︎ 設定兩步\n① iPhone：設定 → 一般 → AirPlay 與接續互動 → 打開 Handoff\n② Mac：系統設定 → 一般 → AirDrop 與接續互動 → 打開接續互動\n​\n◼︎ 記得\n✅ 兩台登入同一個 Apple ID\n✅ 藍牙、Wi-Fi 都要開","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:34:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":112,"replies":15,"reposts":14,"shares":235},"score":184,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfgiXgflA-H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfgiXgflA-H","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"但如果需要多則常用訊息存成快捷！可以使用CopyNow的快捷卡片+鍵盤⌨️\n更方便管理！\napps.apple.com/us/ap…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:03:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}